.TH "hairiokuilo-by-luminaire" "6" "2026-11-14" "Häiriökuilo User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
hairiokuilo-by-luminaire - the command to run Häiriökuilo.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
hairiokuilo-by-luminaire [\f[I]options\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Häiriökuilo is a 4k intro released by Luminaire in august 2017.
Ended 7th in the combined 4k competition at Assembly 2017.
.PP
The intro runs in a window.
The music is generated as raw audio (16 bits, stereo, 44100 Hz) on the
standard output of the intro, and the command pipes it to
\f[B]aplay\f[R](1).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
--help
Display help for the command
.PP
The intro stops by itself after about 53 seconds.
Escape quits.
.SH NOTES
.PP
Only a packed 32-bit binary was released.
The Debian version is the unpacked binary, patched to stay in a window,
because fullscreen breaks the display with SDL 1.2.
The intro always renders in 1920x1080.
.PP
The binary is also patched at build time so that the picture is
displayed with current OpenGL drivers (it stayed white): with NVIDIA,
the shader program was never used, and Mesa refused the shader.
.SH INFOS
.PP
https://www.pouet.net/prod.php?which=71449
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\f[B]aplay\f[R](1)
.SH BUGS
.PP
No known bugs.
